      ],
      "text": "The same Dashboard.consumeMessage handler parses JSON and validates each event against its topic. Invalid messages attempt an INVALID_EVENT rejected_messages insert (ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING), commit partition offset plus one, and return; valid messages call applyEvent, then commit offset plus one. The saved cross-service declaration maps weather.place-requested to this handler as an agent-proposed interaction. Topic resolution, consumer subscription and runtime delivery remain unverified, as do applyEvent's effects for this event."
    },
    "title": "Dashboard place-requested consumer view"
  },
